<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6003] MYSQL Single-Node Use Case with New Database: Error Occurs When Importing Models</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6003</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In the use case, when exporting a model from one project and importing it into another project, an error occurs during model file parsing.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13608861">KYLIN-6003</key>
            <summary>MYSQL Single-Node Use Case with New Database: Error Occurs When Importing Models</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
