                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17928038" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Tue, 18 Feb 2025 11:03:55 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When importing model metadata, the project name of the metadata needs to be obtained first. The current logic for obtaining the project name may use the global metadata&apos;s project name, causing the logic for replacing the metadata project to fail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The logic for obtaining the project name from the metadata will be changed to retrieve it directly from the model metadata.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
